# Routine "Weekly shipped check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Friday afternoon, asks what copy actually went out this week and folds the edits the user made into their voice profile.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/human-copywriter && pi -p "/weekly-shipped-check"
